      "start": 372.72,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "text": "never go to school."
    },
    {
      "start": 375.6,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "text": "There's one moment I'm supposed to like"
    },
    {
      "start": 377.56,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": "have teacher parents meeting, but"
    },
    {
      "start": 380.08,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "text": "instead I met [music] with the school"
    },
    {
      "start": 381.2,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "text": "principal. So, the whole school became"
    },
    {
      "start": 382.72,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "excited. If the teacher start taking"
    },
    {
      "start": 384.76,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "text": "pictures with you,"
    },
    {
      "start": 386.68,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "text": "can imagine the student cannot pay"
    },
    {
      "start": 388.28,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "attention, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": 389.44,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "text": "I stopped going to"
    },
    {
      "start": 391.72,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "school for teachers [music] parents"
    },
    {
      "start": 394.28,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "text": "meeting."
    },
    {
      "start": 395.68,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "text": ">> I think it's not something that I fully"
    },
    {
      "start": 397.52,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "let go of because there's still people"
    },
    {
      "start": 399.2,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "text": "that are like, when I do something well,"
    },
    {
      "start": 400.96,
      "duration": 2.12,
      "text": "they're like, \"Oh, your father is"
    },
    {
      "start": 401.96,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "text": "Suhaimi Yusof, of course you will do"
    },
    {
      "start": 403.08,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "text": "well.\" Sometimes if I do poorly, they'll"
    },
    {
      "start": 404.68,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": "be like, \"Oh, but your father's Suhaimi"
    },
    {
      "start": 406.0,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "text": "Yusof, how come you do poorly?\""
    },
    {
      "start": 410.64,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": "I'm on a 3-day, 2-night trip with my"
    },
    {
      "start": 412.24,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": "dad."
    },
    {
      "start": 414.36,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "text": "During the day I had a chance to talk to"
    },
    {
      "start": 415.96,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "text": "him about how I felt."
    },
    {
      "start": 423.134,
      "duration": 3.146,
      "text": ">> [laughter]"
    },
    {
      "start": 424.28,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": ">> Honestly, Ayah,"
    },
    {
      "start": 426.28,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "sometimes I just wish maybe you were not"
    },
    {
      "start": 428.44,
      "duration": 3.479,
      "text": "that famous."
    },
    {
      "start": 430.24,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "text": "A lot of my friends, they're like, \"Hey,"
    },
    {
      "start": 431.919,
      "duration": 3.401,
      "text": "your father's Suhaimi Yusof, why"
    },
    {
      "start": 433.36,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "text": "sometimes you are like this?\" Or even if"
    },
    {
      "start": 435.32,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": "I do well, they're they're like,"
    },
    {
      "start": 437.76,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "text": "\"Oh, your father's Suhaimi Yusof.\""
    },
    {
      "start": 439.48,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "text": "There's a lot of expectation to your"
    },
    {
      "start": 441.68,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "text": "name."
    },
    {
      "start": 443.0,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": ">> That's a double-edged sword."
    },
    {
      "start": 445.04,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "text": "I mean, being famous has got its perks,"
    },
    {
      "start": 447.44,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "but being famous is also got its"
    },
    {
      "start": 449.44,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "text": "disadvantage."
    },
    {
      "start": 450.88,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "text": "I must say I also feel pressure."
    },
    {
      "start": 453.28,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "text": "I feel pressure because"
    },
    {
      "start": 455.16,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "text": "I cannot afford"
    },
    {
      "start": 456.88,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "text": "to have my son fail."
    },
    {
      "start": 458.2,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "text": ">> Mhm."
    },
    {
      "start": 459.8,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 461.04,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "text": "Back in secondary school when I had my"
    },
    {
      "start": 463.12,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "text": "end level results, my friends and I were"
    },
    {
      "start": 465.04,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "text": "like, \"Okay, let's go to McDonald's.\" I"
    },
    {
      "start": 466.52,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "text": "didn't even think that these results"
    },
    {
      "start": 467.92,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "text": "were like so important to him and he was"
    },
    {
      "start": 471.52,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": "visibly very angry. He's like frowning"
    },
    {
      "start": 473.52,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "text": "and you can tell he's being very quiet,"
    },
    {
      "start": 475.16,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "text": "trying to calm himself when he saw my"
    },
    {
      "start": 476.8,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "text": "results."
    },
    {
      "start": 477.92,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": ">> He did do well for his exam [music] and"
    },
    {
      "start": 479.96,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "text": "I said instead of wasting time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 482.08,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "text": "so might as well go to this private"
    },
    {
      "start": 483.8,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "text": "school"
    },
    {
      "start": 484.96,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "text": "and then I will pay for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 486.68,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "text": ">> Uh which obviously did not improve me in"
    },
    {
      "start": 489.2,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "text": "the slightest."
    },
    {
      "start": 491.08,
      "duration": 6.2,
      "text": ">> Can explain why I spend almost 20,000"
    },
    {
      "start": 494.76,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": "and your result is the same?"
    },
    {
      "start": 497.28,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "text": "It was a carbon print of the previous"
    },
    {
      "start": 499.2,
      "duration": 2.68,
      "text": "failure that you had."
    },
    {
      "start": 500.12,
      "duration": 2.925,
      "text": ">> No."
    },
    {
      "start": 501.88,
      "duration": 1.4,
      "text": "It's just the"
    },
    {
      "start": 503.045,
      "duration": 2.195,
      "text": ">> [laughter]"
    },
    {
      "start": 503.28,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "text": ">> It's just cuz I just felt like I didn't"
    },
    {
      "start": 505.24,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "text": "really have to work hard at the time."
    },
    {
      "start": 506.8,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "text": "Even I don't do well with my exams, I"
    },
    {
      "start": 508.76,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "text": "still get things. Because anything I"
    },
    {
      "start": 510.48,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "text": "want, you would have gifted me anyway."
    },
    {
      "start": 514.0,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "text": ">> When I showed him my results, he"
    },
    {
      "start": 515.4,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "realized that maybe I pampered this boy"
    },
    {
      "start": 516.84,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "text": "way too much. So that's when he decided"
    },
    {
      "start": 519.52,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "text": "just call everyone in front in the"
    },
    {
      "start": 521.32,
      "duration": 2.56,
      "text": "living room and just like take all my"
    },
    {
      "start": 522.76,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "text": "things and just"
    },
    {
      "start": 523.88,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "text": "just destroy my my games, my toys and"
    },
    {
      "start": 527.12,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "all these things. He was very visibly"
    },
    {
      "start": 529.32,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "text": "angry. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 530.56,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": ">> The fact that you destroy all like the"
    },
    {
      "start": 531.92,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "Xboxes and all this, that really that's"
    },
    {
      "start": 534.28,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "the one that actually changed me a bit."
    },
    {
      "start": 536.0,
      "duration": 2.24,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 544.08,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": "No matter what, fathers just want what's"
    },
    {
      "start": 546.32,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "text": "the best for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 547.88,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "I'm very thankful [music] that I still"
    },
    {
      "start": 549.44,
      "duration": 5.92,
      "text": "have time to make up for any of my past"
    },
    {
      "start": 552.64,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "text": "wrongdoings."
    },
    {
      "start": 555.6,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": ">> Oh, so nice actually."
    },
    {
      "start": 557.56,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "text": ">> Okay, good night."
    },
    {
      "start": 558.6,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "text": ">> Good night."
    },
    {
      "start": 570.2,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": ">> I think big garoupa here got"
    },
    {
      "start": 572.48,
      "duration": 2.68,
      "text": ">> Garoupa only."
    },
    {
      "start": 573.64,
      "duration": 2.24,
      "text": ">> Garoupa."
    },
    {
      "start": 575.16,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 575.88,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "text": "We need our bait. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 577.56,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "text": "Okay, come let's fix it."
    },
    {
      "start": 580.68,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "Today, we're going to do a fishing. This"
    },
    {
      "start": 583.36,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "text": "will be opportunity because nobody else"
    },
    {
      "start": 585.4,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "will be there, just me, Sufi, and the"
    },
    {
      "start": 588.0,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "text": "fish."
    },
    {
      "start": 589.48,
      "duration": 6.2,
      "text": "Before he depart from my home, become a"
    },
    {
      "start": 592.52,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "text": "husband to somebody."
    },
    {
      "start": 599.0,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "text": "Been waiting for this fish quite long,"
    },
    {
      "start": 600.6,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": 602.12,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "text": "I'm also waiting for my wedding, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": 605.32,
      "duration": 5.36,
      "text": "My fiance and I we got engaged in"
    },
    {
      "start": 607.44,
      "duration": 5.96,
      "text": "October 2025. And my father gave us a"
    },
    {
      "start": 610.68,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "text": "timeline of at least 2 to 3 years to get"
    },
    {
      "start": 613.4,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "text": "married. But [music] my fiance and I"
    },
    {
      "start": 615.48,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "decided to try and get married within"
    },
    {
      "start": 617.6,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "text": "just 1 year because we've known each"
    },
    {
      "start": 619.52,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "other since 2019."
    },
    {
      "start": 622.24,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "He wants to get married early."
    },
    {
      "start": 624.24,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "text": "Have you secured a job?"
    },
    {
      "start": 626.36,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "What's your financial status? It's not"
    },
    {
      "start": 628.84,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "like girlfriend, boyfriend kind of"
    },
    {
      "start": 630.32,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "contract, you know. This is a lifetime"
    },
    {
      "start": 632.92,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "commitment."
    },
    {
      "start": 635.08,
      "duration": 2.68,
      "text": "You're going to get married. You already"
    },
    {
      "start": 636.8,
      "duration": 1.68,
      "text": "You already booked, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 637.76,
      "duration": 1.48,
      "text": ">> Yes, yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 638.48,
      "duration": 2.359,
      "text": ">> Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 639.24,
      "duration": 2.16,
      "text": ">> And when I first told you you were quite"
    },
    {
      "start": 640.839,
      "duration": 2.561,
      "text": "angry."
    },
    {
      "start": 641.4,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "text": ">> Not angry. It's like I'm surprised why"
    },
    {
      "start": 643.4,
      "duration": 1.92,
      "text": "you do this thing to yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 644.8,
      "duration": 1.88,
      "text": ">> Mhm."
    },
    {
      "start": 645.32,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "text": ">> Why do you rush? For what?"
    },
    {
      "start": 646.68,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": ">> Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 648.2,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": ">> I did tell you I gave you the warning."
    },
    {
      "start": 650.64,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "text": "Slow down and plan properly."
    },
    {
      "start": 652.64,
      "duration": 1.52,
      "text": ">> Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 653.4,
      "duration": 1.52,
      "text": ">> Did you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 654.16,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "text": ">> Mhm."
    },
    {
      "start": 654.92,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "text": ">> So after this advice you slow down?"
    },
    {
      "start": 656.96,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": ">> I think I've slowed down quite a lot"
    },
    {
      "start": 658.16,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "text": "actually. A lot of my friends like"
    },
    {
      "start": 660.4,
      "duration": 2.48,
      "text": ">> Like what?"
    },
    {
      "start": 661.56,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "text": "The wedding date you already booked,"
    },
    {
      "start": 662.88,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "text": "right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 664.6,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "text": "As a father, usually the bigger issue is"
    },
    {
      "start": 667.08,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "text": "always you didn't even respect my point"
    },
    {
      "start": 669.28,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "text": "of view."
    },
    {
      "start": 671.96,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "text": ">> I think what really angered him was"
    },
    {
      "start": 674.0,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "text": "because I didn't have the money at the"
    },
    {
      "start": 676.64,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": "point. But my fiance is working, so she"
    },
    {
      "start": 678.64,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "text": "actually paid for the very first"
    },
    {
      "start": 680.44,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "text": "installment."
    },
    {
      "start": 681.72,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": "He decided to just transfer me the"
    },
    {
      "start": 683.24,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "amount that she paid. I think that was"
    },
    {
      "start": 685.36,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "text": "the only cold period where we didn't"
    },
    {
      "start": 687.12,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "text": "really talk. Simply because I was just a"
    },
    {
      "start": 689.04,
      "duration": 5.36,
      "text": "bit scared of like oh man, what's he"
    },
    {
      "start": 691.04,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "text": "going to say if I walk past him?\""
    },
    {
      "start": 697.0,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "text": "If I say sorry, it's more like I say"
    },
    {
      "start": 698.92,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": "sorry to myself cuz I did it to me, you"
    },
    {
      "start": 701.52,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "text": "know?"
    },
    {
      "start": 702.56,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "No need sorry, lah. Don't say sorry,"
    },
    {
      "start": 704.24,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "text": "lah."
    },
    {
      "start": 706.0,
      "duration": 6.76,
      "text": "Today, I said [music] sorry to my father"
    },
    {
      "start": 708.64,
      "duration": 5.92,
      "text": "and I think I was truly being genuine."
    },
    {
      "start": 712.76,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "text": "And I believe when I said sorry, it did"
    },
    {
      "start": 714.56,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "text": "resolve [music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 715.16,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": "some feelings in me."
    },
    {
      "start": 720.12,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": ">> The reason why I say, \"No, no, don't say"
    },
    {
      "start": 721.92,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "sorry.\" is because like man, we move on."
    },
    {
      "start": 724.88,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "text": "We don't"
    },
    {
      "start": 726.0,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "text": "say sorry because I didn't want him to"
    },
    {
      "start": 727.84,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "text": "go into that little kid mode again, ah."
    },
    {
      "start": 730.48,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "He grew up already. He's going to be a"
    },
    {
      "start": 731.8,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "text": "father soon."
    },
    {
      "start": 734.88,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "text": ">> Transparent fish. Why you get fish, I"
    },
    {
      "start": 736.64,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "text": "get plastic, ah?"
    },
    {
      "start": 745.16,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "text": "Ah, got video show, ah."
    },
    {
      "start": 747.08,
      "duration": 5.76,
      "text": ">> I I have I had help I asked Mommy to"
    },
    {
      "start": 749.16,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "text": "help me get all the photos."
    },
    {
      "start": 755.92,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": "I did prepare a small little gift for"
    },
    {
      "start": 757.68,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "text": "you just to say thank you."
    },
    {
      "start": 760.08,
      "duration": 0.92,
      "text": ">> Huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": 760.4,
      "duration": 1.36,
      "text": ">> You know how we"
    },
    {
      "start": 761.0,
      "duration": 1.44,
      "text": ">> It's your not?"
    },
    {
      "start": 761.76,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "text": ">> Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 762.44,
      "duration": 1.8,
      "text": "You know how you both like Star Wars,"
    },
    {
      "start": 763.76,
      "duration": 1.2,
      "text": "right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 764.24,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "text": ">> Ah, okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 764.96,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "text": ">> Cuz I really got my love of Star Wars"
    },
    {
      "start": 766.68,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "text": "from you."
    },
    {
      "start": 768.16,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "text": "So, this one"
    },
    {
      "start": 769.68,
      "duration": 2.68,
      "text": "is a small baby Yoda."
    },
    {
      "start": 771.52,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "text": ">> Wow."
    },
    {
      "start": 772.36,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": ">> This is I think to symbolize you took"
    },
    {
      "start": 774.88,
      "duration": 2.52,
      "text": "care of me when I was this small until"
    },
    {
      "start": 776.44,
      "duration": 1.8,
      "text": "I'm this big."
    },
    {
      "start": 777.4,
      "duration": 2.48,
      "text": ">> Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 778.24,
      "duration": 1.76,
      "text": ">> I actually have another thing. Another"
    },
    {
      "start": 779.88,
      "duration": 1.56,
      "text": "thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 780.0,
      "duration": 3.388,
      "text": ">> Look at this thing. You always see this"
    },
    {
      "start": 781.44,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "text": "slogan. What does it say?"
    },
    {
      "start": 783.388,
      "duration": 3.972,
      "text": ">> [laughter]"
    },
    {
      "start": 784.92,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "text": ">> The I am your father."
    },
    {
      "start": 787.36,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "text": ">> Okay, thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "start": 789.2,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "text": ">> So, since we have this common ground,"
    },
    {
      "start": 791.64,
      "duration": 2.52,
      "text": ">> Mhm."
    },
    {
      "start": 792.16,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "text": ">> okay, I actually want to give you"
    },
    {
      "start": 794.16,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "text": "something that So, when the first set of"
    },
    {
      "start": 796.36,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "text": "this came out in the market,"
    },
    {
      "start": 798.44,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "text": ">> Mhm."
    },
    {
      "start": 798.76,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "text": ">> this was something which it came with a"
    },
    {
      "start": 801.24,
      "duration": 1.52,
      "text": "certification"
    },
    {
      "start": 802.24,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "text": ">> Oh."
    },
    {
      "start": 802.76,
      "duration": 5.36,
      "text": ">> that it is a original replica."
    },
    {
      "start": 806.52,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "text": ">> You sure you want to give me that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 808.12,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "text": "Okay, so I'm going to give you"
    },
    {
      "start": 810.28,
      "duration": 6.56,
      "text": "something which I will say the line."
    },
    {
      "start": 812.72,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "I am your father."
    },
    {
      "start": 818.12,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "text": "So now I will hand over this to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 820.8,
      "duration": 2.28,
      "text": ">> To me it's like I'm passing over my"
    },
    {
      "start": 822.6,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": "legacy."
    },
    {
      "start": 823.08,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "text": ">> Oh, wow."
    },
    {
      "start": 834.32,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": ">> Okay, thanks. We'll go home now."
    },
    {
      "start": 841.84,
      "duration": 2.36,
      "text": "This was like a fun three days."
    },
    {
      "start": 843.2,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "text": ">> Good."
    },
    {
      "start": 844.2,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "text": ">> This is authentic. [music] It's actually"
    },
    {
      "start": 845.64,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "text": "quite nice."
    },
    {
      "start": 848.76,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "text": "Are you proud of me?"
    },
    {
      "start": 849.92,
      "duration": 5.16,
      "text": ">> Proud?"
    },
    {
      "start": 851.68,
      "duration": 5.48,
      "text": "I'm not proud. I'm damn proud of you."
    },
    {
      "start": 855.08,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "So along the way, you'll make mistakes,"
    },
    {
      "start": 857.16,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "but as long as you can bounce back after"
    },
    {
      "start": 859.84,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "text": "that fall, it's something to be proud"
    },
    {
      "start": 861.88,
      "duration": 1.419,
      "text": "of."
    },
    {
      "start": 862.68,
      "duration": 0.96,
      "text": ">> I love you."
    },
    {
      "start": 863.299,
      "duration": 1.141,
      "text": ">> [music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 863.64,
      "duration": 1.4,
      "text": ">> You know what men do?"
    },
    {
      "start": 864.44,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "text": ">> Uh-huh."
    },
    {
      "start": 865.04,
      "duration": 2.52,
      "text": ">> this with men."
    },
    {
      "start": 869.194,
      "duration": 3.246,
      "text": ">> [laughter]"
    },
    {
      "start": 870.88,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "text": ">> That's our language, okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": 872.44,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": ">> Yeah, that's how we say I love you."
    }
  ]
}